      ],
      "image": "assets/images/10060/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a large saucepan over medium heat, combine corn syrup and white sugar. Bring to a boil, boil for one minute, and remove from heat.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/jmf1kqn3qzAvfDxXu1L4KTbbT6o=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/10060-homemade-peanut-butter-chews-VAT-006-step-02-848fa4b9ce6646798db90c66cffe90d3.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/10060/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir in peanut butter until well blended. Mix in cereal until evenly coated.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/lyl9GIHBKmY8O-kSDYjPqESInUI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/10060-homemade-peanut-butter-chews-VAT-007-step-03-4b7883772cfd492ba62dc11c24abba80.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/10060/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Drop by spoonfuls onto waxed paper.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/N_66I5_iVRc3_z4zwlc73EZyi7c=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/10060-homemade-peanut-butter-chews-VAT-008-step-04-8ac625fed1da484a8c4836d2e4a83e18.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/10060/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a glass bowl in the microwave, or using a double boiler, melt chocolate chips and butterscotch chips, stirring frequently until smooth.",
